0
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
(claps)

0
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:12.800
- That was a rouser, wasn't it?

0
00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:14.800
- That was the first time you ever hit me.

0
00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:16.200
- I didn't hit you very hard.

0
00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:18.000
- The manager came in and found us rolling about

0
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.200
on the floor, biting and scratching like a hand.

0
00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:21.200
There's a deer.

0
00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:24.000
- Ah, I shall never forget his face.

0
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.000
- How ridiculous, how utterly, utterly ridiculous.

0
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:28.000
- We were very much younger then.

0
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:29.800
- And very much sillier.

